:"server","feedback_revision":"bc469bda1830ad86c6d56ede","time_limit":40,"curation_status":"retired","retired_at":"2026-10-27T08:58:47.943104+00:00","reason_code":"replaced_after_academic_review"},{"id":"year_2_1a_math_v_advanced_linear_algebra_second_order_differential_equation_cd224ce4_019","difficulty":"challenge","question_type":"application","question":"Every solution of $x''+4x=0$ is $x(t)=c_1\\cos2t+c_2\\sin2t$. How many solutions satisfy the two conditions $x(0)=0$ and $x(\\pi/2)=0$?","options":["Exactly one, the zero function","Exactly one nonzero solution, $\\sin2t$","Infinitely many, namely $c\\sin2t$ for any $c$","None, because the conditions contradict"],"answer_mode":"server","feedback_revision":"069852db132fe08f35cdfb07","time_limit":40,"curation_status":"retired","retired_at":"2026-10-27T08:58:47.943104+00:00","reason_code":"replaced_after_academic_review"},{"id":"year_2_1a_math_v_advanced_linear_algebra_second_order_differential_equation_cd224ce4_020","difficulty":"challenge","question_type":"application","question":"Every solution of $x''+x=0$ is $x(t)=c_1\\cos t+c_2\\sin t$. Which solution satisfies $x(\\pi)=2$ and $x'(\\pi)=1$?","options":["$x(t)=2\\cos t+\\sin t$","$x(t)=-2\\cos t-\\sin t$","$x(t)=-2\\cos t+\\sin t$","$x(t)=2\\cos t-\\sin t$"],"answer_mode":"server","feedback_revision":"b88d85f2afaf6842e9ba94bb","time_limit":40,"curation_status":"retired","retired_at":"2026-10-27T08:58:47.943104+00:00","reason_code":"replaced_after_academic_review"}]}}